sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Workload owner
    participant O as OpenStack cluster
    participant Q as qrab cluster
    participant N as Service / network authority
    W->>O: Inventory disks, boot identity and network contract
    W->>Q: Rehearse copied data on isolated address
    Q-->>W: Boot / policy / recovery / application evidence
    W->>O: Establish consistency point and stop old writer
    O-->>Q: Final supported data transfer and verification
    Note over O,Q: No cross-platform live-migration protocol is assumed
    W->>Q: Activate target under one-writer procedure
    W->>N: Transfer route / address / DNS authority
    N->>Q: Real user traffic
    Q-->>W: Application and data acceptance
    Note over O,Q: Once target accepts writes, source is stale
    W->>O: Retain source under explicit failback / expiry policy
